[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5161.669, "timestamp": "01:26:01", "text": "呃呃，我意识到我只需要广告。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5164.709, "timestamp": "01:26:04", "text": "休息提醒，当我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5168.31, "timestamp": "01:26:08", "text": "嗯，当我们像这样的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5172.07, "timestamp": "01:26:12", "text": "呃，现场直播，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5175.43, "timestamp": "01:26:15", "text": "我不活跃的时候就不需要它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5178.31, "timestamp": "01:26:18", "text": "出现在流右侧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5181.27, "timestamp": "01:26:21", "text": "所以，我想到了一些办法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5184.95, "timestamp": "01:26:24", "text": "实现自动化，这样当我在稍后回来（BRB）时……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5188.229, "timestamp": "01:26:28", "text": "这段视频里的场景不会发布到 Twitch 上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5192.07, "timestamp": "01:26:32", "text": "聊天，以及当我只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5194.79, "timestamp": "01:26:34", "text": "它们实际上出现在直播中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5196.79, "timestamp": "01:26:36", "text": "只会发布它或类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5200.47, "timestamp": "01:26:40", "text": "那。是的，我得把它弄成十字路口"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5203.43, "timestamp": "01:26:43", "text": "检查我是否在 YouTube 上直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5205.59, "timestamp": "01:26:45", "text": "那就只做那种设置。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5208.39, "timestamp": "01:26:48", "text": "必须这么做。你完全可以赚到美国"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5209.99, "timestamp": "01:26:49", "text": "美元并将其兑换成印度卢比。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5213.02, "timestamp": "01:26:53", "text": "是的，我也能做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5214.87, "timestamp": "01:26:54", "text": "[音乐]"}]